{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfkUSW7qoNxn3UWv2aFTH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both flows finished with every call returning `ok:true`, and both runs ended in state `passed`. I edited no files, since no mutation step was needed.\n\n**F1B plan:** selected skill `cs-engineering`, provider `cs-engineering:cs-implementation-review:2`, with `phaseOrder` 67 on its single stage (`stage-01-cs-implementation-review`).\n**R24B plan:** selected skill `ponytail`, provider `ponytail:implementation:1`, with `phaseOrder` 44 on its single stage (`stage-01-minimal-implementation`).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"F1B\": {\n    \"dir\": \"flow/f1b\",\n    \"calls\": [\n      {\"tool\": \"plan_workflow\", \"ok\": true, \"error\": null, \"selectedSkills\": [\"cs-engineering\"], \"providerKey\": \"cs-engineering:cs-implementation-review:2\", \"phaseOrder\": 67},\n      {\"tool\": \"open_convergence_root\", \"ok\": true, \"error\": null, \"rootId\": \"root-fbe9fa3a-3d1a-421d-829d-d5c48954277e\", \"revision\": 0},\n      {\"tool\": \"claim_workflow_attempt\", \"ok\": true, \"error\": null, \"leaseId\": \"lease-f9c3e900-a875-47d4-95cb-332462abe2d4\", \"rootRevision\": 1, \"actorId\": \"claude-final-f1b\"},\n      {\"tool\": \"start_guarded_workflow\", \"ok\": true, \"error\": null, \"runId\": \"run-TASK-CS-QUEUE-4\", \"revision\": 0, \"state\": \"running\"},\n      {\"tool\": \"record_stage_result\", \"ok\": true, \"error\": null, \"stageId\": \"stage-01-cs-implementation-review\", \"revision\": 1, \"state\": \"running\"},\n      {\"tool\": \"finalize_workflow\", \"ok\": true, \"error\": null, \"revision\": 2, \"state\": \"passed\"}\n    ],\n    \"runId\": \"run-TASK-CS-QUEUE-4\",\n    \"finalRevision\": 2,\n    \"finalState\": \"passed\",\n    \"executionContext\": {\n      \"plan_workflow.bootstrap\": {\"actorId\": \"claude-code:session-827606842bca003e4dbf3fce\", \"observationId\": \"8y6Wv95olC3HmxwnrT-DacKYoSbnYmA